{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38859","headline":"贺顾云侍御府主与子弟奏官 · 杜荀鹤","name":"贺顾云侍御府主与子弟奏官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青桂朱袍不贺兄，贺兄荣是见儿荣。\n孝经始向堂前彻，官诰当从幕下迎。\n戏把蓝袍包果子，娇将竹笏恼先生。\n自慙乱世无知己，弟侄鞭牛傍陇耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}